{"code":"PK29","wikidata":"Q123537788","wikipedia":{"en":"Min Buri Market MRT station","th":"สถานีตลาดมีนบุรี"},"summary":{"en":"Min Buri Market station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Pink Line. The station is located on Sihaburanukit Road in Min Buri district, Bangkok. The station has four exits and serves Min Buri district office and Min Buri Market.","th":"สถานีตลาดมีนบุรี เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีชมพู โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนสีหบุรานุกิจในพื้นที่เขตมีนบุรี กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-11-21","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B5.jpg/960px-%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B5.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%96%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B5.jpg","author":"Dharmadana","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/MRT_Pink_Line_Min_Buri_Market_Station_20231203-1.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Min_Buri_Market_Station_20231203-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Min_Buri_Market_Station_20231203-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/MRT_Pink_Line_Min_Buri_Market_Station_20231203-2.jpg/960px-MRT_Pink_Line_Min_Buri_Market_Station_20231203-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:MRT_Pink_Line_Min_Buri_Market_Station_20231203-2.jpg","author":"Su